<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Physicians Resource starts.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Physicians Resource starts.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.W. Charles said on Thursday analyst Eric Handler had started coverage of Physicians Resource Group Inc with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- In a report, Handler set a 12-month target price of $24 for the stock.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares opened up 1/8 to 12-5/8 on Thursday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
